OL,3,AEA adds AI-generated John Motson to FC
OL,4,A27 video game
OL,5,
OL,6,FEA has exclusively revealed to BBC News
OL,7,Fthat the latest edition of the world's
OL,8,Fmost popular football game, EA Sports
OL,9,FFC, will feature the digitally
OL,10,Frecreated voice of the late BBC
OL,11,Fcommentator John Motson.
OL,13,FMotson, who died in 2023, was the main
OL,14,Fcommentator for BBC Sport for decades -
OL,15,Fand performed the same role for the
OL,16,Fvideo game series during the 90s and
OL,17,F00s.
OL,19,FIt is the first time the hit series,
OL,20,Fformerly known as Fifa, has featured a
OL,21,Fdeceased commentator.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
